Package: classiccompare
Title: Compare Two Datasets and Report Differences
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Sharang", "Nimonkar", email = "sharangnimonkar@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares a base and a comparison data frame and reports
    differences in variables, observations and values, in the style of
    the SAS dataset comparison utility. Observations can be matched by
    position, ID or BY variables. Values are compared exactly or with
    absolute, relative or percent criteria, and a bitmask return code
    supports automated quality control checks.
